      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the sulfonate group-containing structural unit</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may be for example a structural unit derived from vinyl sulfonic acid, allyl sulfonic acid, styrene sulfonic acid, anethole sulfonic acid, acryl amidoalkane sulfonic acid, sulfoalkyl (meth)acrylate, or a salt thereof.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0058">
