        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0059">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the ion</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may be for example an alkali metal ion and in this case, the salt may be an alkali metal sulfonate salt.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0059">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the acryl amidoalkane sulfonic acid</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may be for example 2-acrylamido-2-methylpropane sulfonic acid and the sulfoalkyl (meth)acrylate may be for example 2-sulfoethyl (meth)acrylate, 3-sulfopropyl (meth)acrylate, and the like.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0060">
