      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the sulfonate group-containing structural unit</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may be included in an amount of about 0.1 mol % to about 20 mol %, for example about 0.1 mol % to about 10 mol %, about 1 mol % to about 20 mol %, or about 1 mol % to about 10 mol % based on a total amount of the acryl-based heat resistance binder.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0061">
