      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the acryl-based heat resistance binder and the alkali metal</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may be included in a weight ratio of about 99:1 to about 60:40, for example a weight ratio of about 99:1 to about 70:30, a weight ratio of about 99:1 to about 80:20, or about 90:10 to about 80:20.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0063">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the alkali metal</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may be included in an amount of about 0.1 mol % to about 1.0 mol % based on a total weight of the alkali metal and the acryl-based heat resistance binder.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0064">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
