        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0079">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">a substitution degree of the alkali metal (M &#43; )</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may be about 0.5 to about 1.0, for example about 0.6 to about 0.9, or about 0.7 to about 0.9 relative to (k&#43;n).</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0080">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the substitution degree of the alkali metal</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">satisfies the ranges, the acryl-based heat resistance binder and the separator 10 including the same may exhibit excellent adherence and heat resistance, and oxidation resistance.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0080">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the acryl-based heat resistance binder</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may further include other structural units in addition to the structural units.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0081">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the acryl-based heat resistance binder</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may further include a structural unit derived from alkyl(meth)acrylate, a structural unit derived from a diene-based monomer, a structural unit derived from a styrene-based monomer, an ester group-containing structural unit, a carbonate group-containing structural unit, or a combination thereof.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0081">
