      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the acryl-based heat resistance binder</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may have various forms, that is, an alternate polymer where the structural units are alternately distributed, a random polymer the structural units are randomly distributed, or a graft polymer where a part of structural unit is grafted.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0082">
      </li>
