        <span itemprop="subject">a weight average molecular weight of the acryl-based heat resistance binder</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may be about 200,000 g/mol to about 700,000 g/mol, for example about 200,000 g/mol to about 600,000 g/mol, or about 300,000 g/mol to about 600,000 g/mol.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0083">
