        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0083">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the weight average molecular weight</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may be polystyrene-reduced average molecular weight measured by gel permeation chromatography.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0083">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">a glass transition temperature of the acryl-based heat resistance binder</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may be about 200° C. to about 280° C., for example about 210° C. to about 270° C., or about 210° C. to about 260° C.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0084">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the acryl-based heat resistance binder and the separator 10 including the same</span>
